%% AR-06 Sequence: park, then pay or move
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant A as M4 Parking Check
  participant N as Android notifications
  participant P as Parkering Göteborg app
  participant M as SMS app
  U->>A: I parked here
  A->>A: save car (section, address, time)
  A->>A: plan(): free until, then pay or move
  A->>N: schedule reminders (−15 min, end, stop paying)
  N-->>U: "Free parking ends 09:00 · Pay or move"
  alt paid parking in the section
    U->>N: Open Parkering Göteborg
    N->>P: launch app
    U->>P: start and approve payment
  else SMS fallback
    U->>N: Pay by SMS
    N->>M: compose "801" to 72430
    U->>M: check sign, tap Send
  else street cleaning or 14-day limit
    A-->>U: Move the car
  end
  N-->>U: "Stop paying · permit covers the spot again"
  U->>A: I moved the car
  A->>N: cancel reminders
